  "description": "*Mysterious Slick Scumbag X Prickly Straight-Laced Idol*\n\nKang Beom, currently the hottest idol in South Korea. One day, after drinking a beverage given to him in the waiting room, he dozed off. When he came to, he found himself being assaulted by a huge man. The man, who introduced himself as Seong Wui-Teon, used this incident as leverage to start demanding increasingly unreasonable things from Beom...\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
